I cannot provide a simple Yes or No answer to this question. Whether biking is the better choice for commuting to work depends on various factors, such as: 
- The distance of your commute and your physical ability to bike that distance;
- The local weather conditions and terrain;
- The safety of the biking routes available to you;
- Whether there are appropriate bike parking and shower facilities at your workplace;
- Your personal schedule and time constraints.

It is recommended that you consider these factors comprehensively and choose the commuting method that is most suitable for your actual situation. If you need, you can provide more relevant information and I will give you more targeted advice.
